  <item>
    <title>Vol.62.娱乐圈再次热闹：黄磊黄晓明向佐，热度不减；杨子杨笠，再掀高潮</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/671fd3127ca133e8230d9a56</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">671fd3127ca133e8230d9a56</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 28 Oct 2024 16:04:33 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<myfont><span> </span><p><span>【主播】</span></p><span></span></myfont><myfont><span> </span><p><span>@大树 @小瓜 @门牙 @晨六子</span></p><span></span></myfont><myfont><span> </span><p><br></p><span></span></myfont><myfont><span> </span><p><span>【本期主播叨逼叨】</span></p><span></span></myfont><myfont><span> </span><p><br></p><span></span></myfont><myfont><span> </span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="90">00:01:30</a>&nbsp;看杨子、黄圣依夫妻互动，间接降低离婚率；</span></p><span></span></myfont><myfont><span> </span><p><br></p><span></span></myfont><myfont><span> </span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="166">00:02:46</a>&nbsp;黄圣依后颈的纹身，杨子控制欲强；</span></p><span></span></myfont><myfont><span> </span><p><br></p><span></span></myfont><myfont><span> </span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="390">00:06:30</a>&nbsp;杨子送黄圣依假包；</span></p><span></span></myfont><myfont><span> </span><p><br></p><span></span></myfont><myfont><span> </span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="587">00:09:47</a>&nbsp;杨子做饭，表演天真男孩；</span></p><span></span></myfont><myfont><span> </span><p><br></p><span></span></myfont><myfont><span> </span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="847">00:14:07</a>&nbsp;杨子不敢怼留几手，忌惮他是嘴炮王者；</span></p><span></span></myfont><myfont><span> </span><p><br></p><span></span></myfont><myfont><span> </span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1114">00:18:34</a>&nbsp;杨子、黄圣依有不可说的隐私；</span></p><span></span></myfont><myfont><span> </span><p><br></p><span></span></myfont><myfont><span> </span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1179">00:19:39</a>&nbsp;大树大胆臆测，门牙最毒妇人心；</span></p><span></span></myfont><myfont><span> </span><p><br></p><span></span></myfont><myfont><span> </span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1347">00:22:27</a>&nbsp;娱乐圈真霸总黄晓明，官宣叶珂；</span></p><span></span></myfont><myfont><span> </span><p><br></p><span></span></myfont><myfont><span> </span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1464">00:24:24</a>&nbsp;六子说鞋合不合适只有脚知道，黄晓明挺吃这一款；</span></p><span></span></myfont><myfont><span> </span><p><br></p><span></span></myfont><myfont><span> </span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1691">00:28:11</a>&nbsp;六子试问叶珂抖音私信门牙出来喝一杯咖啡；</span></p><span></span></myfont><myfont><span> </span><p><br></p><span></span></myfont><myfont><span> </span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1910">00:31:50</a>&nbsp;讨厌叶珂；</span></p><span></span></myfont><myfont><span> </span><p><br></p><span></span></myfont><myfont><span> </span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2022">00:33:42</a>&nbsp;小瓜坦言黄磊这类男人需要情绪价值；</span></p><span></span></myfont><myfont><span> </span><p><br></p><span></span></myfont><myfont><span> </span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2207">00:36:47</a>&nbsp;贾斌、黄磊厨艺大比拼；</span></p><span></span></myfont><myfont><span> </span><p><br></p><span></span></myfont><myfont><span> </span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2365">00:39:25</a>&nbsp;会做饭的男人很有魅力；</span></p><span></span></myfont><myfont><span> </span><p><br></p><span></span></myfont><myfont><span> </span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2419">00:40:19</a>&nbsp;黄磊做赛螃蟹；</span></p><span></span></myfont><myfont><span> </span><p><br></p><span></span></myfont><myfont><span> </span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2597">00:43:17</a>&nbsp;大树朋友韩国偶遇何炅，打招呼未被回应；</span></p><span></span></myfont><myfont><span> </span><p><br></p><span></span></myfont><myfont><span> </span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3096">00:51:36</a>&nbsp;女性之光杨笠；</span></p><span></span></myfont><myfont><span> </span><p><br></p><span></span></myfont><myfont><span> </span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4039">01:07:19</a>&nbsp;大树突然Q向佐说还想去香港；</span></p><span></span></myfont><myfont><span> </span><p><br></p><span></span></myfont><myfont><span> </span><p><span>【我们是谁】</span></p><span></span></myfont><myfont><span> </span><p><span>大树(微博：@大树树吧)，互联网设计师，喜欢聊天表达想法，喜欢有新意的观点，也喜欢各种尝试。</span></p><span></span></myfont><myfont><span> </span><p><span>小瓜(微博：@是LIKE呐呐)，东北大妞，一个贼能叭叭，爱好广泛，但琴棋书画样样不通的梦想家。</span></p><span></span></myfont><myfont><span> </span><p><span>门牙(微博：@哈斯迈)，上海普通小青年，有点丧，想要特立独行却屡屡碰壁，后来总结是自己的实力不够啊！</span></p><span></span></myfont><myfont><span> </span><p><span>晨6子（微博：@晨6子），精分双子，脱口秀台下表演者，电台不熟练表达者，一生致力于寻找爱好，破除无聊人生。</span></p><span></span></myfont><myfont><span> </span><p><br></p><span></span></myfont><myfont><span> </span><p><span>【关于娱波未评】</span></p><span></span></myfont><myfont><span> </span><p><span>与我们一起讨论时下热门话题，综艺，电视剧电影吧！来认识更多的朋友，表达不同的看法，一起愉快的玩耍！</span></p><span></span></myfont>]]></description>
